   "text": "up to where the blue paint finishes"
  },
  {
   "from": 30.8,
   "to": 32.14,
   "text": "What's the condition of the building"
  },
  {
   "from": 32.14,
   "to": 33.9,
   "text": "and what does a buyer need to think about?"
  },
  {
   "from": 33.9,
   "to": 36.6,
